# An approval nobody can read cannot be approved, and the tab ring says so.
#
# tooShort is checked twice: in submitOff, which disables the button and takes
# it out of the focus ring, and at the top of submit_ask, which refuses the
# action. Removing either one alone left every arm green, so the file could
# not tell them apart.
#
# The tab arm below fixes half of that: it fails on removing submitOff's
# tooShort and on nothing else. The other half has no arm because it has no
# caller. submit_ask is reached from a click on Approve (dead while submitOff
# holds), from Escape (Cancel, never Accept), and from Enter in
# drive_ask_keyboard --- which needs focus INSIDE the card and OUTSIDE the
# actions row. A too-short card renders one label in its body and no control
# at all, and focus_ui on ask_body, ask_body_content, ask_card and ask_head
# was each stolen back by the sidebar within eight frames. So while submitOff
# stands, submit_ask's guard cannot fire, and the arm that covers it is the
# click below with submitOff's guard removed: that is the revert where the
# click reaches submit_ask, and the pair fails only when BOTH are gone.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":300,"open_tabs":["t2"],"active_tab":"t2","theme":"dark"}
# env: HANABI_ASK_DEMO=longapproval HANABI_ASK_FAIL=echo HANABI_WIN_W=1100 HANABI_WIN_H=300

require_thread t2
expect_text "Too short to show the questions"

click_ui ask_submit
wait_frames 20
expect_no_text "accept — press Approve to try again."

focus_ui ask_submit
key ENTER
wait_frames 20
expect_no_text "accept — press Approve to try again."

click_ui ask_decline
wait_frames 20
expect_no_text "decline — press Deny to try again."

# submitOff's tooShort, alone. A disabled button is out of the focus ring, so
# stepping BACKWARDS out of Decline leaves the card. Drop tooShort from
# submitOff and Approve is live, is a stop again, and is what this lands on.
# submit_ask's guard cannot move a tab stop, so this arm is blind to it.
focus_ui ask_decline
expect_focused ask_decline
shift_tab
wait_frames 8
expect_not_focused ask_submit

# ...and the card is still here, unanswered, after all of it.
expect_text "Too short to show the questions"
expect_text "The agent needs approval"
